<!--
  Only publicly reachable, indexable pages belong here.

  Every /cbat/<game> route sits behind RequireAuth, so a logged-out crawler is
  redirected to /login. Listing those URLs would fill Google Search Console with
  "Page with redirect" exclusions and spend crawl budget on pages that can never
  rank, so they are deliberately absent — they are reached by internal links
  once a user signs in.

  The guide is listed at its clean URL. vercel.json rewrites /cbat-guide to
  /cbat-guide.html, and the document self-canonicalises to the clean form, so
  the .html path must not appear here or the two compete as duplicates.
-->
